     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1. To modernize the income tax arrangements, the Cabinet approved an income tax policy issues paper that includes a direction to address discriminatory provisions in the Income Tax Act regarding the taxation of couples and payment of alimony.</narrative>
    </title>
