    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">2.1. To enhance debt sustainability, the Minister of Finance and Treasury issued a Ministerial Order relating to the development of annual borrowing plans.</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">3.1. To support implementation of the Payment Systems Act, the CBSI operationalized the electronic payments system by: (i) establishing a unit to manage the payments system; (ii) installing the IT system to enable the electronic payments system to be operational; and (iii) demonstrating the electronic payments system is live and used by the four main trading banks.</narrative>
    </title>
